sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant UI as React Shell
    participant Owner as Owning Module
    participant Doc as Documents
    participant Auth as Authorization
    participant Storage as S3-Compatible Storage
    participant Audit as Audit
    participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox

    User->>UI: Upload document to a work record
    UI->>Owner: UploadDocument command
    Owner->>Doc: CreateDocument(metadata, classification, record_ref)
    Doc->>Owner: GetAuthorizationRecordFacts(record_ref)
    Owner-->>Doc: Active link facts or facts_unavailable
    Doc->>Doc: Build candidate DocumentFacts + all active link facts
    Doc->>Auth: DecideAccess(create, actor, EffectiveRestrictionFacts)
    Auth->>Auth: Apply strictest facts and fail closed on missing facts
    Auth-->>Doc: One AccessDecision
    alt Decision allows
        Doc->>Storage: Store binary version
        Storage-->>Doc: Object id and checksum
        Doc->>Doc: Persist metadata, link, and outbox atomically
        Doc->>Audit: Append critical audit when required
        Doc-->>Owner: Document id after commit
        Owner-->>UI: 201 Created
    else Decision denies or any facts unavailable
        Doc-->>Owner: 403 Forbidden
        Owner-->>UI: Access denied
    end

    User->>UI: Download document
    UI->>Owner: GetDocument(id)
    Owner->>Doc: AuthorizeDocumentDownload(actor, document, record_ref)
    Doc->>Doc: Load DocumentFacts and enumerate all active links
    loop Every active document link
        Doc->>Owner: GetAuthorizationRecordFacts(source_ref)
        Owner-->>Doc: Current link facts or facts_unavailable
    end
    Doc->>Auth: DecideAccess(download, actor, DocumentFacts + all active link facts)
    Auth->>Auth: Apply strictest facts and fail closed on missing facts
    Auth-->>Doc: One AccessDecision
    alt Decision allows
        Doc->>Audit: Record sensitive access when required
        Doc->>Storage: Issue short-lived download URL
        Storage-->>Doc: Signed URL
        Doc-->>Owner: Signed URL
        Owner-->>UI: Download response
    else Decision denies or any facts unavailable
        Doc-->>Owner: 403 Forbidden
        Owner-->>UI: Access denied
    end
